**If the method CAN return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION taskStatus = exclusiveTask.getStatus() RESULT CAN BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>YES</value>
